{
  "about": "The Navigation window's three side windows. The title's help button opens \"How to use the Navigation\" at (100, 100) and closes it again. The bottom bar's arrow button opens \"Navigation Icons\" over the window's corner: a press on the sixth of its eight sets makes that the set of arrows on the ground (kept in the settings), and the first puts it back. With a navigation to Prontera running from the field, the route list button opens \"Navigation Info\" at the window's right edge: the warp on this map as the start, then the target. Esc closes the side windows one at a time before it asks about the navigation.",
  "account": "",
  "slot": 0,
  "steps": [
    {"say": "@warp prt_fild08 190 340"},
    {"settle": 1500},
    {"say": "/naviopen"},
    {"wait": 400},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_help"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.sides.0": [100.0, 100.0], "navi_window.sides.1": null}}},
    {"move": [1000, 740]},
    {"shot": "navi-help", "crop": [100, 100, 310, 200], "threshold": 2},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_help"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.sides.0": null}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_sets"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.sides.1": [489.0, 426.0], "settings.navi_icons": 1}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_set_6"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"settings.navi_icons": 6}}},
    {"move": [1000, 740]},
    {"shot": "navi-arrow-sets", "crop": [366, 205, 300, 358], "threshold": 2},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_list"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.sides.2": null}}},
    {"say": "/navi prontera 150/150"},
    {"wait": 800},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navigation.map": "prontera", "navi_window.route": true}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_list"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.sides.2": [648.0, 215.0]}}},
    {"move": [1000, 740]},
    {"shot": "navi-route-list", "crop": [366, 205, 440, 358], "threshold": 3},
    {"shot": "navi-arrows-set-6", "crop": [300, 380, 420, 300], "threshold": 5},
    {"click_on": {"button": "navi_set_1"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"settings.navi_icons": 1}}},
    {"key": "Escape"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.sides.1": null, "navi_window.sides.2": [648.0, 215.0]}, "windows_closed": ["PartyAsked"]}},
    {"key": "Escape"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"state": {"navi_window.sides.2": null}, "windows_closed": ["PartyAsked"]}},
    {"key": "Escape"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"windows_open": ["PartyAsked", "Navigation"]}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "ok"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"key": "Escape"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"windows_closed": ["Navigation"], "state": {"navigation": null}}}
  ]
}
